  "bullets": [
    "Flying demand: est. organ-miles roughly flat (+0.1%) YTD: volume +4.4%, but est. avg distance \u22124.2% (lung \u22127.0%, liver \u22122.9%, heart \u22121.3%).",
    "Volumes: Heart + liver + lung (Strata's core flying organs) fell 2.1% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart, lung and kidney fell 7.2%, 8.9% and 6.6%; liver was roughly flat (+2.0%).",
    "Quarter: Q3 heart+liver+lung \u25b2 5.2% YoY; \u25bc 5.8% vs Q2 (typical Q2\u2192Q3: \u25bc 4.2%); Q4 to date \u25bc 2.1% YoY.",
    "Donors: Deceased donors recovered rose 6.5% over the last 4 weeks vs. last year, and 20.5% of recovered organs have been discarded so far this year (19.6% a year earlier). DCD donors are 53.5% of deceased donors so far this year, up from 49.2% in 2025.",
    "Waitlist: Heart+liver+lung waitlist additions were roughly flat (+1.0%) over the last 4 weeks vs. last year; by organ, heart, lung and kidney fell 2.4%, 6.5% and 4.0%; liver rose 4.2%.",
    "Regions: biggest moves over the last 4 weeks vs. last year: Northwest (Region 6) \u25b2 16.9%, Upper Midwest (Region 7) \u25bc 12.2%, New York (Region 9) \u25bc 11.2%."
  ],
